@inventoryUrl = http://localhost:3001
@transfersUrl = http://localhost:3002
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3003
@managerToken = {{loginManager.response.body.$.token}}
@staffToken = {{loginStaff.response.body.$.token}}
@transferId = {{createTransfer.response.body.$.transferId}}

### ---------- LOGIN (through the Inventory service) ----------
### Run L01 and L02 first: the other tests use their tokens.

### L01 Log in as manager (expect 200 with a token)
# @name loginManager
POST {{inventoryUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "cloud123",
  "password": "Cloud123456"
}

### L02 Log in as staff (expect 200 with a token)
# @name loginStaff
POST {{inventoryUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "staff12",
  "password": "Staff12344"
}

### ---------- PREPARE A TRANSFER (Transfers service) ----------

### K00 Health check (expect 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### K01 Staff asks to move 10 boxes from Cairo to Alexandria (expect 201, PENDING)
# @name createTransfer
POST {{transfersUrl}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromWarehouseId": "WH-101",
  "toWarehouseId": "WH-1795391950080",
  "itemId": "ITM-102",
  "quantity": 10
}

### K02 Dispatch before it is approved (expect 409 WRONG_STATUS "not approved yet")
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/dispatch
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### K03 Manager approves it (expect 200, APPROVED)
PATCH {{transfersUrl}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "approve"
}

### ---------- DISPATCH ----------

### D01 No token (expect 401 UNAUTHORIZED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/dispatch

### D02 Transfer that does not exist (expect 404 TRANSFER_NOT_FOUND)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/TRF-0000/dispatch
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### D03 Staff dispatches it (expect 200, DISPATCHED, an OUT movement, Cairo stock goes down by 10)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/dispatch
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### D04 Dispatch it again (expect 409 WRONG_STATUS "already dispatched")
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/dispatch
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### ---------- RECEIVE ----------

### V01 The same person who dispatched it tries to receive it (expect 403 SAME_PERSON)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receivedQuantity": 10
}

### V02 More than was dispatched (expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receivedQuantity": 11
}

### V03 Units missing but no note (expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receivedQuantity": 8
}

### V04 Body is not JSON (expect 415 UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA_TYPE)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: text/plain

8 boxes

### V05 Manager receives 8 of 10 with a note (expect 200, RECEIVED, missingQuantity 2, an IN movement)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receivedQuantity": 8,
  "note": "Two boxes crushed in the truck"
}

### V06 Receive it again (expect 409 WRONG_STATUS "already received")
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receivedQuantity": 8,
  "note": "Again"
}

### ---------- MOVEMENT HISTORY ----------

### H01 History of one item (expect 200: the OUT and IN movements, newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/ITM-102/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### H02 Item that does not exist (expect 404 ITEM_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/ITM-0000/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### H03 Every movement in Alexandria (expect 200: only IN movements)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movements?warehouseId=WH-1795391950080
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### H04 No token (expect 401 UNAUTHORIZED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movements

### H05 The transfer now shows RECEIVED on the Transfers service (expect 200)
GET {{transfersUrl}}/api/transfers?status=RECEIVED
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### ---------- SHIPMENT MESSAGES (SNS -> SQS) ----------

### M01 Read the dispatch and receipt messages of D03 and V05 (expect 200, two messages)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### M02 Read again: each message is delivered once (expect 200, empty list)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### M03 No token (expect 401 UNAUTHORIZED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages
